      <p><strong>Jumpei F. Yamagishi</strong> ([dʒúnpèɪ]; 山岸純平) is a theoretical biophysicist. My research combines nonequilibrium statistical physics, dynamical-systems theory, and microeconomics to understand complex biological systems as metabolism and microbial ecosystems.</p>
      <br>
    <ul>
      <li>"F." stands for Fuyukusa (冬草), my pen name for haiku (俳句).</li>
      <li>Likes: SF & History novels (Toh Enjoe); Haiku; Bouldering</li>
      <li>Keywords: Naïvety; Paradox, Phenomenology; 換骨奪胎</li>
    </ul>
    <br>
